y-hits-a-1b-revenue-run-rate-up-4x-0-c2b6352c27/","observation_id":"obs_c2b6352c27cb01c4de0b5aa7f96be2b7b1572fff9becd4055f886b8d802f7df1","published_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:56Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这期 AI 行业简报重点关注 Perplexity 年化收入突破 10 亿美元及估值变化，同时汇总 Qwen4-Max、模型安全评估、智能体基础设施和推理性能等进展。","title":"[AINews] Perplexity hits a $1B revenue run rate, up 4x in 2026"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_319b25ba2c0eeac770f0c2fe4598a32101d72d351f10a9e6b7dcb45a8aa5c881","internal_url":"/posts/20261118-arxiv-vira-toward-ultra-high-resolution-visual-agents-vi-0-51009fb859/","observation_id":"obs_51009fb859c1b51e38a4b6a73e59273e7d2a9ad7bec47f9e9cda8bfa869b4fff","published_at":"2026-11-16T18:59:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇工作提出 CrossRPO，通过对比不同版本的图像训练视觉智能体，使模型必须定位并读取局部证据，才能完成整组问答。作者据此构建了 ViRA-Train、ViRA-Bench 和 ViRA-Bench-Real，并训练出 ViRA-9B 与 ViRA-27B。","title":"ViRA: Toward Ultra-High-Resolution Visual Agents via Cross-Input Relative Policy Optimization"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":31,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.484375,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":17,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.265625,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.1875,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":10,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.15625,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":6,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.09375,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccurrence":6,"graph_node_id":"tag:Announcements","id":"tag:Announcements","jaccard":0.09375,"topic":"Announcements"},{"cooccurrence":5,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.078125,"topic":"Advanced (300)"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon SageMaker AI","id":"tag:Amazon SageMaker